<title>HONG KONG: China Assets 1996 net down 80.3 percent.</title>
<headline>China Assets 1996 net down 80.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	  0.6	 vs  3.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)   1.0	 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 1.58 loss vs  0.48 loss</p>
<p>    Net			   0.46	vs  2.32</p>
<p>    Turnover		    2.76	vs  2.15 (see note)</p>
<p>    Company name		China Assets (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 June 20-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  July 27</p>
<p>NOTE - China Assets is an investment company.</p>
<p>Turnover of the last corresponding period has been reclassified to conform with the current year's presentation.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for diminution in value of joint venture and listed investments, disposal of listed investments and provision for investment written back.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is one U.S. cent vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
